{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33779","headline":"追和幽独君诗次韵 二 · 皮日休","name":"追和幽独君诗次韵 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"恨剧但埋土，声幽难放哀。\n坟古春自晚，愁绪空崔嵬。\n白杨老无花，枯根侵夜台。\n天高有时裂，川去何时回？\n双睫不能濡，六藏无可摧。\n不闻搴蓬事，何必深悲哉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33779.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33779","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}